approch: 
- Filtered out irrelevant seat reservations (seats 1 and 10).
- Utilized bit manipulation (bitmasks) to track seat availability in seats 2 through 9 for each affected row.
- Checked possible 4-seat combinations (Left, Right, Middle) using predefined binary masks.
- Computed unreserved rows mathematically to bypass O(N) row traversal.
Complexity
- Time Complexity: O(M) where M is the number of reservations.
- Space Complexity: O(M) to store the bitmasks of affected rows in a Hash Map.
